{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月4日，據路透社報道，OpenAI在今年10月披露，公司在一間高管會議室內發現了一個被人偷偷安放的錄音設備。對此，許多OpenAI前員工的反應如出一轍：他們並不感到意外。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584976.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:59.150066+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:57:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_hash":"2578d58ab62fb515a4c5e3c775885bbd04e9dc509f1b3b48025e22c4a7a2230d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}